WEBVTT

00:02.377 --> 00:04.921
Are ya ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:05.004 --> 00:06.423
I can't  hear  you.
我听不到你说话。

00:06.506 --> 00:08.341
Kids:
Aye, aye, Captain.
孩子们：
是的，是的，船长。

00:08.425 --> 00:11.094
♪ Ohh... ♪
♪ 哦...♪

00:11.177 --> 00:13.263
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:13.680 --> 00:15.724
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:15.807 --> 00:17.600
Captain: ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
队长：♪ 吸水性的，黄色的
他是多孔的 ♪

00:17.684 --> 00:19.436
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:19.519 --> 00:21.646
Captain: ♪ If nautical nonsense
be somethin' you wish ♪
船长：♪ 如果是航海方面的废话
成为你所希望的那样 ♪

00:21.730 --> 00:23.440
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:23.523 --> 00:25.525
Captain: ♪ Then drop on the
deck and flop like a fish ♪
队长：♪ 那么就降落在
像鱼一样翻牌和翻牌♪

00:25.608 --> 00:27.110
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:27.193 --> 00:28.278
Captain: ♪ Ready? ♪
队长：♪ 准备好了吗？ ♪

00:28.361 --> 00:29.571
All: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
全部： ♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:29.654 --> 00:31.656
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:31.740 --> 00:33.658
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:33.742 --> 00:37.370
Captain: ♪ SpongeBob
SquarePants ♪
队长：♪ 海绵宝宝
方裤♪

01:02.145 --> 01:03.897
Nice try, "Alarmy..."
不错的尝试，“警报……”

01:03.980 --> 01:05.356
But you gotta
get up pretty early
但你必须
起得很早

01:05.440 --> 01:08.234
to wake  me  up on picture day.
在拍照日叫醒我。

01:09.611 --> 01:11.196
Now, if you'll
excuse me, Gary...
现在，如果你愿意
对不起，加里……

01:11.279 --> 01:13.907
I must go
make myself picturesque.
我必须走了
让自己如画。

01:41.851 --> 01:42.936
Perfect.
完美的。

01:43.019 --> 01:44.312
I'm ready, whoo-hoo!
我准备好了，呼呼！

01:52.362 --> 01:54.697
Fine, fine,
not to worry, no problem.
很好，很好，
不用担心，没问题。

02:02.205 --> 02:05.208
I'm ready, again.
我又准备好了

02:06.709 --> 02:08.670
It's time to take
a corrective approach.
是时候采取行动了
纠正方法。

02:11.673 --> 02:13.550
Good morning, Squidward.
早上好，章鱼哥。

02:13.633 --> 02:14.968
I'd love to stop and chat
right now,
我很想停下来聊天
现在，

02:15.051 --> 02:16.511
but it's picture day.
但今天是拍照日。

02:43.496 --> 02:45.540
Still looking good, "Spongie"
《海绵宝宝》看起来还是不错的

02:45.623 --> 02:48.585
and boating school
is just around the corner.
和划船学校
就在拐角处。

02:52.964 --> 02:54.215
Take cover!
掩护！

02:54.299 --> 02:56.092
The teenagers,
they've been let out of school
青少年们，
他们被放出了学校

02:56.175 --> 02:58.469
and they're pelting us
with balloons filled with...
他们向我们投掷
与装满...的气球

03:00.346 --> 03:01.556
Ketchup?
番茄酱？

03:01.639 --> 03:04.309
Save yourself, kid.
救救你自己吧，孩子。

03:04.392 --> 03:06.394
I'm finished.
我完成了。

03:10.773 --> 03:12.609
Teenager: Got you!
少年：抓到你了！

03:12.692 --> 03:14.569
Wait, wait, don't squirt!
等等等等，别喷！

03:14.652 --> 03:16.696
Please, you've got to spare me.
拜托，你一定要饶过我。

03:16.779 --> 03:18.323
I've got picture day today.
我今天有拍照日。

03:18.406 --> 03:20.617
Oh, pictures, huh?
哦，图片，是吗？

03:20.700 --> 03:23.161
Well, let me help you
with your makeup, hah!
好吧，让我来帮助你
加上你的妆容，哈！

03:36.883 --> 03:39.427
Well, I'm not sure
how I did it, but I...
嗯，我不确定
我是怎么做到的，但是我...

03:39.510 --> 03:42.138
Oh!
哦！

03:42.221 --> 03:43.222
Fiddlesticks.
小提琴。

03:43.306 --> 03:45.016
Missed again.
又错过了。

03:48.561 --> 03:51.397
And now, as an extra precaution
现在，作为额外的预防措施

03:51.481 --> 03:54.025
to keep me looking
shiny and new...
让我继续寻找
又亮又新...

03:58.237 --> 04:01.699
No grime can penetrate
the glossy sheen of...
污垢无法渗透
……的光泽

04:01.783 --> 04:03.284
♪ SpongeGloss ♪
♪ 海绵光泽 ♪

04:14.003 --> 04:15.380
There it is.
就在那里。

04:15.463 --> 04:17.382
So close...
这么近...

04:17.465 --> 04:18.967
And still so shiny.
而且还是那么闪亮。

04:31.562 --> 04:33.523
Hey, it's just water.
嘿，这只是水。

04:38.444 --> 04:41.114
... Nah, nah!
... 不，不！

04:41.197 --> 04:42.240
Stamps?
邮票？

04:45.952 --> 04:47.412
: Oatmeal.
: 燕麦片。

04:47.495 --> 04:48.705
Glue.
胶水。

04:56.629 --> 04:57.797
Hey, buddy.
嘿，伙计。

04:57.880 --> 04:59.298
Patrick, a little privacy?
帕特里克，有一点隐私吗？

04:59.382 --> 05:00.633
Oh, sorry, SpongeBob.
哦，对不起，海绵宝宝。

05:00.717 --> 05:03.428
I just came over
to borrow some jelly.
我刚过来
借一些果冻。

05:03.511 --> 05:04.804
Well, go ahead...
好吧，继续吧……

05:04.887 --> 05:06.639
But I don't have
time to play right now.
但我没有
现在就该玩了。

05:06.723 --> 05:08.016
I am late for picture day
我拍照日迟到了

05:08.099 --> 05:10.184
and I just can't seem
to get to school
我就是看不出来
去学校

05:10.268 --> 05:13.021
without being covered
by unsightly debris.
而不被覆盖
由难看的碎片。

05:13.104 --> 05:15.148
If only I had
a sealed barrier
如果我有的话
密封屏障

05:15.231 --> 05:18.651
to protect me from the
filth of the outside world.
保护我免受
外界的污秽。

05:18.735 --> 05:20.695
I have the solution.
我有解决办法。

05:23.531 --> 05:24.741
Ew.
呃。

05:27.785 --> 05:30.413
I have solved
my hunger problem.
我已经解决了
我的饥饿问题。

05:30.496 --> 05:32.540
That's it!
就是这样！

05:32.623 --> 05:35.668
This jelly jar will insulate me
这个果冻罐可以让我隔离

05:35.752 --> 05:37.378
from the dirty dregs
of Bikini Bottom.
从肮脏的渣滓中
的比基尼底部。

05:37.462 --> 05:39.672
If you don't mind, Patrick,
we don't have much time.
如果你不介意的话 帕特里克
我们没有太多时间。

05:45.928 --> 05:47.638
We're here.
我们到了。

05:47.722 --> 05:50.767
Hey, why'd I bring jelly for?
嘿，我为什么要带果冻？

05:50.850 --> 05:51.976
Uh, Patrick...
呃，帕特里克...

05:52.060 --> 05:53.269
Oh, yeah.
哦，是的。

05:53.352 --> 05:55.021
I was gonna put it
on this peanut butter taco.
我本来打算把它
在这个花生酱炸玉米饼上。

05:55.104 --> 05:57.106
No, no, no, no, no, Patrick!
不，不，不，不，不，帕特里克！

05:57.190 --> 05:58.816
I'm not jelly,
I'm not jelly!
我不是果冻，
我不是果冻！

06:01.694 --> 06:03.529
SpongeBob, get out of my taco.
海绵宝宝，滚出我的玉米饼。

06:08.034 --> 06:09.869
What's the matter, SpongeBob?
怎么了，海绵宝宝？

06:09.952 --> 06:14.373
Patrick, I just want
to take a decent picture today
帕特里克，我只想
今天拍一张像样的照片

06:14.457 --> 06:18.169
because someday, I will
graduate from boating school
因为有一天，我会
划船学校毕业

06:18.252 --> 06:21.422
and I don't want
to be remembered as the guy
我不想
被铭记为这个人

06:21.506 --> 06:23.007
covered in peanut butter
涂上花生酱

06:23.091 --> 06:26.052
and taco shells  .
和炸玉米饼壳。

06:26.135 --> 06:28.096
There you are.
你就在那里。

06:30.139 --> 06:32.183
Say cheese.
说奶酪。

06:33.893 --> 06:36.187
And here's the last one.
这是最后一个。

06:36.270 --> 06:39.899
Now, just give a nice smile
to the camera, SpongeBob.
现在，只要给一个美好的微笑
对着镜头，海绵宝宝。

06:39.982 --> 06:42.985
Wait, can I go home
and change first?
等等，我可以回家吗
并先改变？

06:43.069 --> 06:43.820
No time.
没时间。

06:43.903 --> 06:45.780
Say cheese.
说奶酪。

06:45.863 --> 06:48.991
: Cheese, cheese,
cheese, cheese.
：奶酪，奶酪，
奶酪，奶酪。

06:49.075 --> 06:51.452
Quit that moody brooding.
停止那种喜怒无常的沉思。

06:51.536 --> 06:53.746
This will clean you up.
这会让你干净。

06:54.956 --> 06:56.666
Don't snivel like that.
别这样抽鼻子。

06:56.749 --> 06:58.376
A winner doesn't snivel.
胜利者不会哭泣。

06:58.459 --> 07:00.461
Try putting this on.
尝试穿上这个。

07:01.754 --> 07:03.714
This is it.
就是这样。

07:03.798 --> 07:06.217
Now you are looking
like a winner.
现在你正在寻找
就像赢家一样。

07:09.053 --> 07:12.807
SpongeBob, please stop crying
海绵宝宝，请别哭

07:12.890 --> 07:14.600
so he can take the picture.
这样他就可以拍照了。

07:14.684 --> 07:16.686
Do not worry, Mrs. Puff.
别担心，普夫夫人。

07:16.769 --> 07:17.812
I brought Pearlie.
我带了皮尔莉来。

07:17.895 --> 07:19.856
I can't stop crying.
我无法停止哭泣。

07:19.939 --> 07:21.941
This will make you smile...
这会让你微笑...

07:22.024 --> 07:24.402
Ja, whether you
want to or not.
贾，无论你
想要或不想要。

07:26.779 --> 07:28.823
Now, say cheese.
现在，说奶酪。

07:28.906 --> 07:29.866
Cheese.
奶酪。

07:33.953 --> 07:35.955
There I am.
我就在那里。

07:36.038 --> 07:39.250
Hey, I don't look
so bad after all.
嘿嘿，我不看
毕竟太糟糕了。

07:55.975 --> 07:57.768
Krabs: Yeesh, we need
some customers in here.
螃蟹：是的，我们需要
这里有一些顾客。

08:02.064 --> 08:03.649
What's gotten into you?
你怎么了？

08:03.733 --> 08:05.193
Oh, I don't know.
哦，我不知道。

08:07.945 --> 08:09.739
What's happening to me?
我这是怎么了？

08:09.822 --> 08:11.532
I think I can explain.
我想我可以解释一下。

08:11.616 --> 08:14.869
Yes, I've seen this one before.
是的，我以前见过这个。

08:14.952 --> 08:16.621
It's a common symptom.
这是一个常见的症状。

08:16.704 --> 08:19.332
Patrick is suffering
from Krabby Patty withdrawal.
帕特里克正在受苦
从克拉比帕蒂退出。

08:19.415 --> 08:20.958
He needs one
他需要一个

08:21.042 --> 08:22.960
or he'll keep mumbling about it
for the next 3-1/2 minutes.
否则他会一直咕哝着
接下来的 3-1/2 分钟。

08:23.044 --> 08:25.087
Ooh, he needs one, eh?
哦，他需要一个，嗯？

08:25.171 --> 08:28.007
Methinks a paying customer's
in our midst.
我认为付费客户的
在我们中间。

08:28.090 --> 08:32.220
Patrick, how's a Krabby Patty
with extra cheese sound?
帕特里克，蟹肉饼怎么样
有额外的奶酪声音吗？

08:33.304 --> 08:34.222
Give me!
给我！

08:34.305 --> 08:35.431
Not yet.
还没有。

08:35.514 --> 08:36.599
First, I have to know.
首先，我必须知道。

08:36.682 --> 08:38.684
Can you pay for it?
你能付钱吗？

08:38.768 --> 08:40.811
Oh, yeah, I can pay for it.
哦，是的，我可以付钱。

08:40.895 --> 08:42.438
Good boy.
好孩子。

08:52.907 --> 08:54.450
Narrator: 10 seconds later.
旁白：10秒后。

08:56.619 --> 08:57.870
My good man, how you doing?
我的好人，你好吗？

08:59.497 --> 09:00.706
Good.
好的。

09:00.790 --> 09:02.416
Now, let's get
down to business.
现在，让我们得到
言归正传。

09:02.500 --> 09:03.376
What's that?
那是什么？

09:03.459 --> 09:04.460
It's your bill.
这是你的账单。

09:04.543 --> 09:05.670
I don't have any money.
我没有钱。

09:05.753 --> 09:07.004
What?
什么？

09:07.088 --> 09:08.256
I thought you said
you could pay for it.
我以为你说
你可以付钱。

09:08.339 --> 09:10.466
Oh, I'm paying for it,
all right.
哦，我付钱了，
好吧。

09:11.676 --> 09:12.885
Non-paying customer!
非付费客户！

09:17.557 --> 09:18.766
Huh?
啊？

09:18.849 --> 09:21.269
You're gonna pay,
one way or another.
你要付钱，
无论如何。

09:22.520 --> 09:23.938
All right, Patrick...
好吧，帕特里克...

09:24.021 --> 09:25.523
If you're not gonna pay
for your food with money
如果你不打算付钱
用钱买食物

09:25.606 --> 09:28.609
you're gonna pay
with hard, physical labor.
你要付钱
艰苦的体力劳动。

09:28.693 --> 09:30.611
I want you to swab the latrine.
我要你擦拭厕所。

09:30.695 --> 09:33.197
I'll be back in a while
to check up on you.
我一会儿就回来
检查你的情况。

09:33.281 --> 09:34.490
:
Bottom-feeding imbeciles.
：
底层喂养的低能儿。

09:34.573 --> 09:36.492
No problem.
没问题。

09:36.575 --> 09:38.286
♪ Tra-la-la-la-la ♪
♪ 啦啦啦啦 ♪

09:38.369 --> 09:39.704
♪ Work, work, work, work ♪
♪ 工作，工作，工作，工作 ♪

09:39.787 --> 09:41.497
So, Patrick, how are you...
那么，帕特里克，你怎么样……

09:42.790 --> 09:44.417
What in blazes did you do?
大火中你做了什么？

09:44.500 --> 09:47.211
I accidentally tried
the hand soap.
我无意中尝试过
洗手液。

09:50.298 --> 09:52.550
It doesn't taste
as good as it smells.
没味道
和闻起来一样好。

09:55.636 --> 09:57.430
See these ice cube trays?
看到这些冰块托盘了吗？

09:57.513 --> 09:59.598
I want you to put 'em
in that bucket.
我要你把它们
在那个桶里。

09:59.682 --> 10:01.434
How do I do it?
我该怎么做？

10:01.517 --> 10:03.269
Figure it out.
弄清楚吧。

10:03.352 --> 10:05.563
Uh...
呃...

10:05.646 --> 10:08.357
I have to be very gentle.
我必须非常温柔。

10:10.109 --> 10:11.027
What the...
什么...

10:11.110 --> 10:12.236
What are you doing?
你在干什么？

10:12.320 --> 10:14.989
Almost done, Mr. Krabs.
快完成了，蟹老板。

10:16.407 --> 10:18.367
You've destroyed
me refrigerator.
你已经毁掉了
我的冰箱。

10:18.451 --> 10:22.580
You've destroyed many of
the things I love.
你已经毁掉了很多
我喜欢的东西。

10:22.663 --> 10:24.373
I got another job that even
我找到了另一份工作

10:24.457 --> 10:26.667
a nimrod like you
couldn't mess up.
像你这样的尼姆罗德
不能搞砸了。

10:26.751 --> 10:28.377
All's you gotta do
所有你必须做的事

10:28.461 --> 10:30.296
is throw
all of these trash bags
是扔
所有这些垃圾袋

10:30.379 --> 10:33.799
down the trash chute, like so.
掉进垃圾​​槽，就像这样。

10:33.883 --> 10:34.675
See?
看？

10:34.759 --> 10:36.135
Yup.
是的。

10:36.218 --> 10:37.595
Because if you mess  this  up
因为如果你把事情搞砸了

10:37.678 --> 10:39.597
you'll never eat
another Krabby Patty again.
你永远不会吃东西
又是一个蟹肉饼。

10:41.724 --> 10:43.309
Hurry, hurry, hurry!
快点，快点，快点！

10:43.392 --> 10:46.187
Here, boy, take this sack
of loot and put her in me safe.
来吧，孩子，拿着这个袋子
的战利品并将她安全地放在我身边。

10:46.270 --> 10:47.938
Okey-dokey, Mr. Krabs.
好吧，蟹老板先生。

10:49.231 --> 10:50.274
Huh?
啊？

10:50.358 --> 10:51.525
Hurry, hurry, hurry, hurry.
快点，快点，快点，快点。

10:52.735 --> 10:53.944
SpongeBob: Patrick?
海绵宝宝：帕特里克？

10:54.028 --> 10:55.237
What's up, buddy?
怎么了，哥们？

10:55.321 --> 10:56.697
I have to get rid of this trash
我必须摆脱这个垃圾

10:56.781 --> 10:57.948
but it won't go down.
但它不会下降。

10:59.784 --> 11:02.119
That's because you didn't hit
the trash compactor switch.
那是因为你没有击中
垃圾压实机开关。

11:07.666 --> 11:10.044
SpongeBob, you're a genius!
海绵宝宝，你真是个天才！

11:11.670 --> 11:13.339
Oh, no, there's one left.
哦，不，还剩一张。

11:13.422 --> 11:16.258
Patrick, that's not a...
trash bag.
帕特里克，那不是……
垃圾袋。

11:19.261 --> 11:20.137
No!
不！

11:20.221 --> 11:22.139
Why won't you go down?
你为什么不下去？

11:24.100 --> 11:26.143
Well, well, let's see how
the poor boy's doing.
好吧好吧，让我们看看如何
那个可怜的男孩正在做的事。

11:26.227 --> 11:28.521
Well, did you earn me
money back yet, Patrick?
嗯，你赚到我了吗
钱还回来了吗，帕特里克？

11:40.199 --> 11:41.492
Can I eat now?
我现在可以吃东西吗？

11:59.677 --> 12:01.053
Thank you, Mr. Postman.
谢谢你，邮递员先生。

12:01.137 --> 12:04.390
Thanks, Gary.
谢谢，加里。

12:04.473 --> 12:07.601
Hm, can't read
the return address.
嗯，读不懂
返回地址。

12:07.685 --> 12:10.354
Maybe this'll shed some light.
也许这会带来一些启发。

12:10.438 --> 12:11.647
"Hey, SpongeBob.
“嘿，海绵宝宝。

12:11.730 --> 12:13.566
It's your cousin, BlackJack.
这是你的表弟，布莱克杰克。

12:13.649 --> 12:15.234
Guess what?
你猜怎么着？

